p.src:
Each row obeys a continuity equation. With the index convention just chosen, $\frac{\partial T^{\nu0}}{\partial t}
  +
  \frac{\partial T^{\nu1}}{\partial x}
  +
  \frac{\partial T^{\nu2}}{\partial y}
  +
  \frac{\partial T^{\nu3}}{\partial z}
  =0.$ Equivalently, $\boxed{
  \partial_\mu T^{\nu\mu}=0
  }.$ If the symmetric convention $T^{\mu\nu}=T^{\nu\mu}$ is already in use, this is the familiar $\partial_\mu T^{\mu\nu}=0$.

