p.src:
A freely falling particle follows a space-time geodesic. With proper time $\tau$ as an affine parameter, $\boxed{
  \frac{d^2x^\mu}{d\tau^2}
  +
  \Gamma^\mu{}_{\nu\sigma}
  \frac{dx^\nu}{d\tau}
  \frac{dx^\sigma}{d\tau}
  =0
  }.$

